OL,3,GNEWSALakeside venue attracts thousands
OL,4,Asince reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 7,800 people visited
OL,7,FTelford's recently restored lakeside
OL,8,Famphitheatre over the summer.
OL,10,FThe 400-seat venue reopened in July for
OL,11,Fthe first time since the 1990s and put
OL,12,Fon a range of theatre, comedy, family
OL,13,Fshows and free band days.
OL,15,FEarlier in the summer it went through a
OL,16,Fsix-week refit, including the
OL,17,Freplacement of the stage, which sits at
OL,18,Fthe waters edge.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
