OL,3,GNEWSALakeside venue attracts thousands
OL,4,Asince reopening
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela McClements, the Telford and
OL,7,FWrekin councillor responsible for
OL,8,Fculture, tourism and leisure, said it
OL,9,Fhad been a "fantastic first season for
OL,10,Fthe amphitheatre".
